# Build-context exclusions for the repository root (SUITE-041 / HC6).
#
# Six of the eight service images build with `context: .` (see
# docker-compose.yml), so THIS file is the one Docker reads for them —
# Docker only honours a `.dockerignore` at the context root, which means the
# per-subproject files were dead for every `context: .` build.
#
# Without it the context was ~60 GB: shared/ (23G runtime data), .dev/ (23G),
# .export/ (7.6G datasets) and .venv313/ (3.1G) were sent to the daemon on
# every build. Nothing here is copied by any Dockerfile.
#
# NET-006 raised the stakes of this file: otalon-capture/Dockerfile no longer
# lists the modules under src/ one by one, it copies the tree wholesale
# (`COPY otalon-capture/src/ /app/src/`) so a new module cannot silently miss
# the image. Keeping non-runtime content OUT of the image is therefore this
# file's job now, not the Dockerfile's. Before ADDING a pattern here, check no
# Dockerfile COPYs a matching path — an over-broad rule is the mirror-image
# failure of NET-006 and equally silent at build time.

# --- VCS / tooling -----------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitmodules
.github
.kilo
.claude
openspec

# --- Runtime + working data (never part of an image) -------------------
shared/
.dev/
.export/
.tools/

# --- Local envs and secrets -------------------------------------------
.venv*
venv/
.env
.env.*
!.env.compose.sample

# --- Python build/test artefacts ---------------------------------------
# Load-bearing for the wholesale `COPY src/` in otalon-capture (NET-006):
# these are what keeps caches and test material out of the image.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.hypothesis/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov/
**/tests/
**/test/
**/test-results/
**/conftest.py
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py

# --- Node ---------------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.nuxt/
**/.output/
**/dist/
**/playwright-report/

# --- Editor / OS / VCS leftovers ---------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
**/*.bak
**/*~
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/*.ipynb

# Markdown files are not broadly excluded: some are runtime prompt/configuration
# inputs or may be required by a checked-in build recipe. Dockerfiles explicitly
# copy only the runtime files they need.
